	(text "Relay machine clock sequencer: 37 G6S-2 relays do the sequencing (windows -> relay contacts); the only active timing part is one\nLMC555 + one 74HC4017 (the 'when' of the position cycle).  Stop / run / home / end decisions are relay contacts.\nSee README.md: principle, timetable, verification."
